{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11202390","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11202390","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1120239001:1":{"text":"I really just can't win with you...","source_cn":"我果然还是赢不了你……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x00D6436EDF300008","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1120239002:1":{"text":"So give up. I'm not going back with you.","source_cn":"放弃吧，我不会和你回去的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BF57664C80007B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1120239003:1":{"text":"I'm not giving up.","source_cn":"我不会放弃。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC560ECDC3E0F62CE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"I'm not giving up.","female":"I'm not giving up.","variant_male_record_index":"120005","variant_female_record_index":"120006","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120239004:1":{"text":"I can't beat you, but I refuse to let my father's hard-earned position be taken away so easily.","source_cn":"虽然我打不过你，但我绝不会把父亲好不容易的得到的族长之...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD74ED80C47388EFB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1120239005:1":{"text":"If you don't want to be chief, then so be it. I'll beat Kruger myself and take up the mantle of the Grimmaw Clan.","source_cn":"你不愿意继承族长，无所谓。我会凭借自己的力量赢过克鲁格...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93D9933A129AB3A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1120239006:1":{"text":"Do what you please. Like I said, the Grimmaw Clan's got nothing to do with me.","source_cn":"随便你。我说过的，你们黑嚎氏族的事情与我无关。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86EB6FDFEF8A8866","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1120239007:1":{"text":"... I'll show you.","source_cn":"……我会成功给你看的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x539B2D8A2478B9AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1120239008:1":{"text":"Come and watch me beat Kruger.","source_cn":"所以，你也过来吧，见证我打败克鲁格。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01BABAA882777746","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1120239009:1":{"text":"Wanna go watch? I'm curious, myself.","source_cn":"我们要过去看看吗？我还挺好奇的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCECD764F73C52443","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1120239009":{"text":"Wanna go watch? I'm curious, myself.","source_cn":"我们要过去看看吗？我还挺好奇的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCECD764F73C52443","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1120239010:1":{"text":"Great minds think alike, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>!","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x239F27CC90185663","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Great minds think alike, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>!","female":"Great minds think alike, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>!","variant_male_record_index":"120013","variant_female_record_index":"120014","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1120239011:1":{"text":"Additionally, shouldn't the Uru Clan chief be a witness for something like this?","source_cn":"就当是作为乌尔氏族的族长，如何？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC7994A401022795","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1120239014:1":{"text":"... So be it. We'll go as witnesses from the Uru Clan, and nothing more.","source_cn":"……既然如此，我们会作为乌尔氏族的代表见证这件事，仅此而已。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1598911ADB1C5749","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:0:1":{"text":"Let's go!","source_cn":"我们过去吧","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0409A711372ED638","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Let's go!","female":"Let's go!","variant_male_record_index":"63440","variant_female_record_index":"63441","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1120239012:1":{"text":"I don't care who wins, and I don't really want to go.","source_cn":"……对我来说，他们谁赢都无所谓。但我不太想再过去了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E28B7AE69B51A27","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1120239013:1":{"text":"But what about as chief of the Uru Clan? We need a witness from each clan in the Ashen Wastes.","source_cn":"……以乌尔氏族族长的名义呢，我们需要荒角沙漠另一个氏族...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BA9F363F3808C3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:1:2":{"text":"Let Soren decide.","source_cn":"索恩决定吧","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0D91094E57DF3F9B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Let Soren decide.","female":"Let Soren decide.","variant_male_record_index":"63442","variant_female_record_index":"63443","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:库金":{"text":"Kojin","source":"库金","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:索恩":{"text":"Soren","source":"索恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:阿尔萨":{"text":"Alsa","source":"阿尔萨","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":18,"localized_text_count":17,"speaker_count":3}}